"""
PSA Overstow Automation (v5)
============================
Downloads vessel/yard/load/servicing reports from the PSA portal and
SharePoint via Selenium, then triggers the Excel macro (Run_All) in
Servicingforvessel.xlsm to build the FINAL report and open an Outlook
email draft.

HANDOVER NOTES
--------------
- All activity is logged to the on-screen log box AND to a rotating text
  log file (see LOGFILE below) so issues can be diagnosed after the fact
  even when this is run as a double-clicked .exe with no console.
- Uncaught errors (both inside Tk callbacks and at the top level) are
  caught, logged to LOGFILE, and shown in a message box instead of
  failing silently — see install_error_handlers() near the bottom.
- Config (saved usernames/dates) is written atomically (temp file +
  rename) so a crash mid-save can't corrupt psaconfig.json.
- No functional/business logic below was changed as part of this pass;
  changes are limited to error handling, logging, and minor safety nets.
"""

